Blocky DNS Server with REST API Extensions

This product includes software developed by
0xERR0R (https://github.com/0xERR0R/blocky)

Modifications:
- Added REST API endpoints for dynamic DNS record management (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/dns/records)
- Added file-based persistence for dynamic DNS records

This product is a derivative work of the blocky DNS proxy and ad-blocker project.
See https://github.com/0xERR0R/blocky for the original project.
